{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03129","headline":"与袁补阙寻蔡拾遗会此公出行後蔡有五韵诗见赠以此篇答焉 · 张九龄","name":"与袁补阙寻蔡拾遗会此公出行後蔡有五韵诗见赠以此篇答焉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辙迹陈家巷，诗书孟子邻。\n偶来乘兴者，不值草玄人。\n契是忘年合，情非累日申。\n闻君还薄暮，见眷及兹辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}